ce daily), presenting with significant unintentional weight loss and dizziness. The weight loss and dizziness are concerning for hyperglycemia and potential metabolic decompensation.", "subjective": "Mr. Asadiya presents with uncontrolled diabetes symptoms, including dizziness and significant unintentional weight loss (5-6 kg in the past month). He was diagnosed with diabetes 3 months ago following dizziness. He reports taking Metformin 500mg once daily, despite a twice-daily prescription, and has not noticed symptom improvement. Dizziness impacts his ability to perform physically demanding farming duties."}, "snomedCodes": ["Type 2 diabetes mellitus (disorder)", "Dizziness (finding)", "Weight loss (finding)", "Physical demanding activity (qualifier value)", "Metformin (substance)", "Medication adherence problem (finding)"], "recommendations": []}}	{"host": "34.14.174.141", "accept": "*/*", "x-real-ip": "111.125.253.79", "connection": "close", "user-agent": "curl/8.18.0", "content-type": "application/json", "content-length": "25371", "x-forwarded-for": "111.125.253.79", "x-forwarded-proto": "http"}	f	\N	(sqlalchemy.dialects.postgresql.asyncpg.IntegrityError) <class 'asyncpg.exceptions.NotNullViolationError'>: null value in column "created_at" of relation "patient_documents" violates not-null constraint\nDETAIL:  Failing row contains (a78f1378-99b7-43b8-88e9-df0391186996, 6612382c-d684-418b-b3fa-7cdea6a555c1, PRESCRIPTION, null, 1025091308_compressed.pdf, application/pdf, null, null, null, null, 2919590d-42cf-4ff9-9732-f6eae9b4cc1a, cmscy8sdz00dptb3qj2ep10ok).\n[SQL: \n                INSERT INTO patient_documents (id, external_id, patient_id, clinic_id, kind, file_name, mime_type)\n                VALUES (gen_random_uuid(), $1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6)\n                RETURNING id\n            ]\n[parameters: ('cmscy8sdz00dptb3qj2ep10ok', UUID('6612382c-d684-418b-b3fa-7cdea6a555c1'), UUID('a78f1378-99b7-43b8-88e9-df0391186996'), 'PRESCRIPTION', '1025091308_compressed.pd